    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Step sideways, see which kind of dream waits.</em></p><p>Once per <strong>turn</strong>, when your Domain generates or receives a <strong>Spark Lead</strong> (a clue, ping, or emergent phenomenon pointing toward a Spark), you may spend <strong>10 Soft Power marks</strong> to perform a Sapphire Lucidity check.</p><ul><li>You immediately learn whether the next Spark is <strong>Conceptual</strong>, <strong>Vestigial</strong>, or <strong>Animate</strong>.</li><li>This insight cannot reveal power level, danger tier, or location—only the metaphysical <strong>class</strong> of the Spark.</li></ul><p>This is not divination. It’s memory from the world-that-was.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"dwSapphireLucid\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Lucid Step</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/turn (10 Soft Power marks) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">When your Domain generates or receives a Spark Lead, spend 10 Soft Power marks for a Sapphire Lucidity check: learn whether the next Spark is Conceptual, Vestigial, or Animate. No power level / danger / location info — class only.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
